WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:13.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.860
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.440
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:38.600
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.180
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:56.200
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.560
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.610
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:09.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.180
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:44.700
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.100
<i>The wild girl they met in the forest, Jasmine.</i>

00:01:54.500 --> 00:02:00.900
<i>She has been living in this forest with her two companions, Filli and Kree.</i>

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.500
<i>Lief and Barda, who are on a quest to find the topaz,</i>

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:12.300
<i>Ignored Jasmine's warnings and
entered the deepest part of the forest.</i>

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.000
<i>The 'darkness within darkness'.</i>

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.400
<i>There was a frightening place guarded by Gorl.</i>

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.850
It's the topaz!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.050
Who are you two?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.650
We are travellers.

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:48.300
We came from the city of Del. Who are you?

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.250
My name is Gorl.

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:54.050
I am the guardian of this place.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:59.000
Those who enter here are considered my enemies.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.500
Lief!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.350
W-What is this?!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.400
Lief...!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.050
The enemy is a terrifying guardian.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.900
There's nothing I can do...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.650
This strength... there's no use fighting it.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:30.400
Then...!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.600
Th...This is!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.200
You thief...

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:57.900
On my knight's honour, I will punish you.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:06.100
You are going to join these corpses...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.750
...And become sustenance for the vines!

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.600
What... is that?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:31.450
Don't play dumb. Those are, indeed, the Lilies of Life.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.600
Don't tell me you don't know what they are, you thief!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.800
You're wrong!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.200
What's wrong?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.150
We're not here to steal anything like that!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.750
Are you trying to deceive me?

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.500
It's exactly as he said.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.100
That's not our goal.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.150
Don't lie to me.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.000
You two want the Lilies of Life.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.350
I know you do.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.550
Barda!

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.600
What are the Lilies of Life?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:15.650
When those flowers blossom, you will receive eternal life when you drink the trickling nectar.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.400
That's why they're called the Lilies of Life.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.400
Eternal life?

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.700
The one who's going to drink that nectar is me!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:27.500
Then I will become the leader of the Seven Clans of Deltora.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.400
What are you saying?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:34.000
The seven clans were united under Adin long ago!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.600
Adin? What's that?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.600
He doesn't know who Adin is?

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.400
That can't be...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.100
I do not know this 'Adin'!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:56.350
I have been protecting the Lilies of Life.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.800
I'm not certain how much time has passed.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:04.450
But I have never once heard of the name Adin!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:10.900
No way... You've been here since before Adin united Deltora!

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.450
Th...This is...!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:21.400
I don't want to put you guys in danger...

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.900
But, I can't just leave them either.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.600
Kree!

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.600
Thanks, you two.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:40.350
Adin? Who is this 'Adin' you speak of?

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.350
The Book of Deltora...

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.700
<i>The Book of Deltora.</i>

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.100
<i>In it, the following is stated:</i>

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.400
<i>Long ago, in the land of Deltora, there existed seven tribes.</i>

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:57.300
<i>Each of the seven clans possessed a gem which they had obtained from the earth.</i>

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.500
<i>Each of these seven gems held great magical power.</i>

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.700
<i>One day, the dark ruler, the Shadow Lord,</i>

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:10.200
<i>Came from the mountains and attacked Deltora.</i>

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:23.100
<i>Then, a great hero appeared.</i>

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.180
<i>His name was Adin; a blacksmith.</i>

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.450
<i>One night, Adin had a strange dream.</i>

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.450
<i>The dream told him:</i>

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:36.800
<i>Take seven sheets of metal and beat them thin,</i>

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.850
<i>Creating a thin chain.</i>

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:45.750
<i>The seven clans all handed their gems to him.</i>

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:50.450
<i>With the seven gems set into Adin's belt,</i>

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.800
<i>He fastened it around his waist.</i>

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:57.350
<i>The belt shone brightly, just like the sun."</i>

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:03.300
"Then the Seven Clans of Deltora united under Adin.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:07.400
They successfully banished the King of Shadows, the Shadow Lord."

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:13.450
Then Adin became Deltora's first king.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.400
Are you trying to trick me with your fairytale?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.450
No!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.050
It really happe-

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.950
Enough!

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:26.400
Now become nutrients for the vines!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.500
Wait! You coward!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.200
What? Coward?

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.900
You think I'm a coward?!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:46.400
You wear the armour of a knight, but you are not a true knight!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.200
A true knight...?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.500
Their armour is the same as yours.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:54.750
Which means, they were your comrades!

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.180
Why did they die?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:05.500
My...my comrades...

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.100
My brothers...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.200
Your brothers?

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.650
It couldn't... It couldn't be helped...!

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:18.900
There wasn't enough to share with my brothers.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:25.700
To attain eternal life, we had to drink one cup full of nectar.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.100
That's right...

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:32.850
That's why we got in each other's way.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.100
We fought over the lilies.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:43.400
While I defeated those two, the lilies closed and the nectar disappeared into the ground.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:48.300
Regardless, the lilies were now mine.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:56.500
Thinking of when they would next bloom, I made walls with vines to protect them from intruders.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.500
It succeeded.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.800
There's nothing more that grows well like these vines.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:07.400
To let the vines grow, I killed the branches that were in the way.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:16.900
People, birds, beasts - I killed everyone that got in my way, their flesh and blood used to grow the vines.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.050
How could you...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.900
And so I protected the treasure.

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:29.000
I've waited a long time for the lilies to bloom again.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:33.750
Soon... Very soon my dream will come true!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.300
Gorl!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:49.300
We did it!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.500
What? It doesn't feel like I've pierced anything...

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:21.600
Barda!

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:26.000
You dirty thief.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.850
May you suffer...

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.650
And die!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.400
Barda!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.100
Barda!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.200
And the next one...

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:45.400
Is you.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:46.400
Gorl!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.100
Over here!

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.200
Listen, Gorl.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.700
You heartlessly mistreated this place.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:59.400
For the sake of your own greed, you hurt the trees and killed the birds.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.200
And what of it?

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.200
I... won't forgive you!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:11.900
What are you doing?!

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:15.100
Lief! Get to the centre of the area!

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.100
Hurry up!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.100
Okay!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.150
It's the topaz!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.000
Yes!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.000
It's the topaz.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:18.250
Topaz, the symbol of faith!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:19.990
Barda!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.100
Barda!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.300
Come on! Wake up!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.000
Barda is...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.800
He's still breathing! We have to... We have to do something!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:39.600
Lief.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.800
What should we do?

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.450
Lief!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.900
Jasmine...

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.100
Look at that.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.000
The Lilies of Life are...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.580
That's it!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:34.400
Shit...

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.150
Our journey had only just started.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.900
And yet... now hes...!

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:52.700
I'm what, Lief?

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.100
Barda... Barda!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.850
S-Sorry.

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:04.000
And, what happened with Gorl?

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.000
I see.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.500
He was crushed under all of this.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.400
So I was almost killed by him...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.800
What was that?

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.150
I see.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:45.500
His physical body disappeared long ago.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:50.200
All that was left in his armour was his soul.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:56.950
But because the armour was destroyed, his soul disappeared, taking in the rays of light.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.300
'Eternal life'...

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:06.350
So in the end, the tree branches fell by chance and we were able to defeat him.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:07.650
How lucky-

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.900
That's not right.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:13.200
I asked them to. That's why they listened to me.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.100
The trees did?

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:20.900
I promised them that in return for doing what I asked, I would get rid of the vines from all of the trees.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:27.850
That tree said that as long as they become free, it's fine to sacrifice a few branches.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:31.900
We were saved by Jasmine again.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.600
And by you too.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.500
Huh?

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:38.500
You're the one who poured the Lily of Life's nectar into my mouth, right?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.500
Well... yeah.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.200
I almost forgot!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.300
It withered.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:03.300
I still got a tiny bit of the nectar.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:06.500
It's not quite enough to gain eternal life, though...

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.750
It's not going to bloom anymore?

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.800
No, it will.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:15.500
Because the sun will continue to shine here.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.350
The sun, huh...

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.900
That's the rock from earlier.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.900
That's what you were looking for?

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:30.450
This is the topaz! According to the Book of Deltora, it represents faith-

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:31.800
Let me see it.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:39.000
It's said that "the topaz represents faith, and also can open the door to the realm of the dead."

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.150
Filli? Kree?

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:50.000
Lief? Barda?

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.450
Where are you...?

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:01.900
Jasmine... Jasmine...

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.900
My beautiful Jasmine.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.900
Mum!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.400
Mum!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.400
Jasmine!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.800
Mum, where were you?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.000
I'm sorry, Jasmine.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.100
I don't have much time.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:28.300
So listen carefully to what I'm going to say.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:34.500
You've been doing so well since you were separated from your Dad and I.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:39.450
But now, you have to face something even greater.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.150
Look.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.800
Lief and Barda.

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.150
Those two are your allies.

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:51.400
They're both travelling to free Deltora from the Shadow Lord.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.450
Mum...?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.950
Therefore Jasmine,

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:00.600
You will leave this forest and join them.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.300
Please help those two.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.600
That is your destiny.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:07.300
I understand.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.300
But Mum...

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:13.000
I'm always here for you.

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:16.600
Do your best, and stay strong.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.000
Jasmine,

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.800
My beautiful girl.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:31.500
Jasmine?

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:37.240
"The topaz will open the door to the realm of the dead",

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:40.650
You said that earlier, right?

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.100
Y-Yeah...

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:52.100
That means my Mum isn't alive anymore.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:56.500
I was hoping that she might be...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.300
Jasmine...

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:07.100
But, I also gained some hope.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.700
My Mum told me to join you two.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:18.400
You guys are my allies, but because you're a little unreliable, she said to lend you a hand.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.500
She said that's our destiny.

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:23.550
'Our'?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:24.950
She's talking about Filli.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.300
And Kree too!

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:32.300
Do as you will.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.500
The creatures of the forest are...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:51.600
Like how the forest gained back the sun, it will give you hope if we banish the darkness in this world!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.600
Oh, how cool.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.300
Uh, no... It's not like that...

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.900
Barda! I'm your lifesaver!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.800
But, he's right.

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.200
Let's get going on our journey of hope!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.950
Yeah. Along with this symbol of faith, the topaz!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.250
My job is simply to follow the belt's way.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.700
And for me, to follow the cape.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:28.700
In this way, Lief obtained the first gem, the topaz.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:36.030
This is the belt that I got from my father; the Belt of Deltora.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:39.900
Like this, I'm going to put each gem in it.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:43.500
That's pretty.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:46.400
Now we've got the first one.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.500
I'm sure if Jarred finds out, he'll be happy.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.000
So, about our next destination...

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.000
The closest place from this forest is...

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:58.950
The Lake of Tears?!

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.750
Anywhere but there!

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:01.900
What's wrong?

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.750
You decided to join us, right?

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:09.300
What's at the Lake of Tears?

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:15.800
You're right, Kree.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:22.000
That's the territory of Thaegan, a very terrifying sorceress.

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:24.700
The sorceress... Thaegan?

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:41.050
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:46.720
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:52.680
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:58.450
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:05.750
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.350
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:17.130
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:24.100
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:32.340
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:38.280
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:44.290
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:50.600
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:58.810
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:07.400
Gorl.

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:11.810
The Golden Knight who protects the Lilies of Life.

00:24:11.810 --> 00:24:16.760
Even though his body has rotted away, leaving only his soul, he still seeks eternal life.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:19.600
He's able to control his opponents with supernatural powers.

00:24:20.650 --> 00:24:25.310
We finally got our hands on our first gem, the topaz, the symbol of faith.

00:24:25.310 --> 00:24:27.210
Now for the Lake of Tears.

00:24:27.210 --> 00:24:30.800
On the way, the dreadful sorceress, Thaegan, has placed her trap right in our way!

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:31.730
The Enigmatic Giant's Curse

00:24:31.730 --> 00:24:34.570
Next time, 'The Enigmatic Giant's Curse'!
